<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-INDIA 179-9 IN 50 OVERS V SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 179-9 IN 50 OVERS V SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH, South Africa 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>India scored 179 for nine off their 50 overs in the triangular series one-day match against South Africa on Sunday.</p>
</text>
